---
// Android 1.1.2 product terms, verified in the KR Play listing. No US release-date or iOS claim.
---
<section class="app-section words-eps-en-section" id="android-eps-topik-en" aria-labelledby="words-eps-en-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="words-eps-en">
      <p class="words-eps-en-eyebrow">Android · EPS-TOPIK</p>
      <h2 id="words-eps-en-title">Try the first two decks free</h2>
      <p>There are seven EPS-TOPIK (Employment Permit Korean) vocabulary decks. <strong>EPS-1 and EPS-2 are free.</strong> To open EPS-3–7, buy the bundle or lifetime access.</p>
      <p>From Android 1.1.2, there are no daily limits on new-word study, reviews, or quizzes in decks you can access. The new-word goal defaults to 20 a day and can be changed in Settings. After reaching it, keep going with 10 more words at a time.</p>
      <p>The app contains ads, and paid decks are optional purchases. For new Premium purchases, a one-time lifetime purchase unlocks all paid decks and removes ads. Existing monthly subscribers keep their plan.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .words-eps-en-section { scroll-margin-top: 6rem; }
  .words-eps-en {
    min-width: 0;
    padding: clamp(1.25rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-default);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    background: var(--bg-card);
  }
  .words-eps-en-eyebrow {
    margin-bottom: .65rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: .875rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .words-eps-en h2 {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2rem);
    line-height: 1.3;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }
  .words-eps-en p:not(.words-eps-en-eyebrow) {
    margin-bottom: .85rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.7;
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }
  .words-eps-en p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .words-eps-en strong { color: var(--text-primary); }
</style>
